#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Feature compatibility {#feature-compatibility}"
msgstr "Compatibilidad de prestaciones {#feature-compatibility}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Certain runtime features cannot be used together in a single job. Click the "
"appropriate tab for a list of features that are incompatible with the "
"selected feature:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ciertas prestaciones (características) de runtime no pueden usarse juntas en"
" un solo trabajo. Haz clic en la pestaña correspondiente para ver una lista "
"de prestaciones incompatibles con la prestación seleccionada:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Dynamic\" label=\"Dynamic circuits\">\n"
"  Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Dynamic\" label=\"Circuits dinámicos\">\n"
"  Incompatible con:\n"
"  - ZNE por plegado de gates\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  - Desacoplamiento dinámico\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling is incompatible with the [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction.\n"
"  - Compatible with fractional gates when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 or later.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Otras notas:\n"
"  - El gate twirling puede aplicarse a circuits dinámicos, pero solo a gates que no estén dentro de bloques condicionales.\n"
"  - El twirling de medición solo puede aplicarse a mediciones terminales.\n"
"  - El twirling de medición es incompatible con la instrucción [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store).\n"
"  - Compatible con gates fraccionales cuando se usa `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 o posterior.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"DD\" label=\"Dynamical decoupling\">\n"
"  Incompatible with dynamic circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"DD\" label=\"Desacoplamiento dinámico\">\n"
"  Incompatible con circuits dinámicos.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "  </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"Fractional\" label=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"  Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"Fractional\" label=\"Gates fraccionales\">\n"
"  Incompatible con:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Compatible with dynamic circuits when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 "
"or later.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Compatible con circuits dinámicos cuando se usa `qiskit-ibm-runtime` "
"v0.42.0 o posterior.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"ZNE\" label=\"Gate-folding ZNE\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"ZNE\" label=\"ZNE por plegado de gates\">\n"
"    Incompatible con:\n"
"  - Circuits dinámicos\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  - PEC\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Might not work when using custom gates.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Twirling\" label=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"  Incompatible with fractional gates or with stretches.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Es posible que no funcione cuando se usan gates personalizados.\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Twirling\" label=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"  Incompatible con gates fraccionales o con stretches.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks. Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Does not work with non-Clifford entanglers.\n"
msgstr ""
"  Otras notas:\n"
"  - El gate twirling puede aplicarse a circuits dinámicos, pero solo a gates que no estén dentro de bloques condicionales. El twirling de medición solo puede aplicarse a mediciones terminales.\n"
"  - No funciona con entrelazadores no Clifford.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEA\" label=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEA\" label=\"PEA\">\n"
"    Incompatible con:\n"
"  - Circuits dinámicos\n"
"  - Gates fraccionales\n"
"  - ZNE por plegado de gates\n"
"  - PEC\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEC\" label=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Gate-folding ZNE\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"
msgstr ""
"  <TabItem value=\"PEC\" label=\"PEC\">\n"
"    Incompatible con:\n"
"  - Circuits dinámicos\n"
"  - Gates fraccionales\n"
"  - ZNE por plegado de gates\n"
"  - PEA\n"
"  </TabItem>\n"

